{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Higher Quasicoherent Sheaves"},2],"author":[{"Plain":"Germán Stefanich"},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"参考资料. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"StefanichHigherQCoh"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>https://gstefanich.github.io/Thesis.pdf</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My PhD thesis. The first half contains a number of results in the theory of enriched higher categories, culminating in a discussion of monads and the enriched monadicity theorem. The second half builds upon the two papers below and develops the theory of quasicoherent sheaves of (∞, n)-categories in derived algebraic geometry.</p>\n<p>来源: https://gstefanich.github.io/</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}}